        "created_at": "2014-11-13T17:19:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Donner\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/donner/48/1903_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Donner:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>Pydro wrote:</b><br><blockquote>Ummm.....there are no promo environments.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nShouldn't there be?Wagner Moon BaseTh Ruins of DetroitMinilopolisTierra del FuegoJust swap out one card from each deck. &nbsp;I leave the specific card as an exercise for the audience.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>A promo environment would be interesting. I could possibly imagine a constant ongoing effect being added to each environment, and a promo would just replace that ongoing effect. But that just makes things more complicated.</p>\n<p>For example, Insula Primalis could add stealth to one target, as if a hero were hiding in the jungle from all of the dinos (or vice-versa!).</p>",
